    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc345970253150868f774a63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我闭口不言，专心地倾听着新宇宙所说的话。\r\n没错——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8ad9460fa8dfce00b1d097cc4eaae3bae786c3fad298d4343be9834c92f2bef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf37f47e12e3e0587f196df6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要我们两人在一起，那便能去到任何地方。\r\n一定，能够去到任何地方……",
