      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，这也是在『天皇赏（春）』之前，\r\n让新宇宙喘口气的大好时机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe49559bfe5e2ee0cb7f178e6a30a7fb7beb15ebcd548b3fa0794274613f899",
