      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进王同学，你可不要又用力过猛，\r\n把球扔进旁边的球道里面去了哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "802089d2b56a55350634485988e249bd8b7695b65d651b5764ee9133a9c59915",
